Description:
 linuxmuster-tools7 - Tools for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-tools7 (1:7.4.20~edu1) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * LMNFile allows /etc/linuxmuster/webui/config.yml and
     /usr/lib/linuxmuster-webui/plugins again. A server upgraded from
     deb.linuxmuster.net keeps linuxmuster-webui7 for now, and the webui reads
     both paths through LMNFile while its plugins load: with 1:7.4.20~edu it
     crashed on its next restart with "OSError: Access refused" (lmn_users,
     lmn_quotas, ...). linuxmusterTools itself keeps reading
     /etc/linuxmuster/tools/ldap.yml. Both entries go again with the release
     that removes the webui.
